---
// Ported verbatim from v1's blog-cloud-kitchen-future.html (PRD §8 superseded
// block). Route is the AGENTS.md-bound slug /blog/cloud-kitchen-future/.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../lib/data';

const title = `Why Cloud Kitchens Are the Future of Food in Sundargarh | ${site.business.name}`;
const description =
  'Discover why cloud kitchens are changing the food scene in Sundargarh. Faster delivery, affordable pricing, and fresh food—powered by The Oven Vibe.';
const pageUrl = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).toString();
const ogImage = new URL('/static/images/blog_images/blog_5.webp', Astro.site).toString();
const waLink = `https://wa.me/${site.business.whatsapp}`;

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BlogPosting',
  headline: 'Why Cloud Kitchens Are the Future of Food in Sundargarh',
  image: ogImage,
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: site.business.name },
  publisher: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: site.business.name,
    logo: {
      '@type': 'ImageObject',
      url: new URL('/static/images/brand_images/The%20Oven%20vibe_logo.webp', Astro.site).toString(),
    },
  },
  datePublished: '2024-06-05',
  description: 'Discover why cloud kitchens are changing the food scene in Sundargarh.',
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta
      name="keywords"
      content="cloud kitchen in Sundargarh, online food delivery Sundargarh, cloud kitchen benefits, The Oven Vibe cloud kitchen, affordable food Sundargarh, future of food Sundargarh"
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Discover why cloud kitchens are changing the food scene in Sundargarh. Faster delivery, affordable pricing, and fresh food."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content={pageUrl} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />
  </Fragment>

  <BlogPostLayout line1="CLOUD" lineGradient="KITCHENS." subtitle="Why cloud kitchens are the future of food in Sundargarh.">
    <p class="subtitle" style="font-weight: 600; color: #555; margin-top: -10px">
      Restaurant ka naya style, smart aur simple
    </p>

    <picture>
      <source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_5.avif" />
      <source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_5.webp" />
      <img
        src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_5.webp"
        alt="Cloud Kitchens Future in Sundargarh"
        class="blog-img"
        loading="lazy"
        width="1200"
        height="675"
        style="background: #eee"
      />
    </picture>

    <p>
      Sundargarh ka food scene fast change ho raha hai 🚀 Log ab sirf tasty food nahi, fast
      delivery, affordable price aur consistency chahte hain. Yahin se cloud kitchens ka role
      start hota hai ☁️
    </p>

    <h3>What Is a Cloud Kitchen? 🤔</h3>
    <p>Cloud kitchen ek aisa food setup hota hai jahan:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>No dine-in</li>
      <li>Sirf online & takeaway orders</li>
      <li>Focus on food quality & speed</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Simple words mein—kam cost, zyada focus on taste 😋</p>

    <h3>Why Cloud Kitchens Work Best in Sundargarh 🌆</h3>
    <p>Sundargarh jaise towns ke liye cloud kitchens perfect fit hain.</p>
    <p><strong>Key reasons:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Lower operating cost → lower food prices</li>
      <li>Fast preparation & delivery</li>
      <li>Fresh food, no long waiting</li>
      <li>Online ordering convenience 📲</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>How Cloud Kitchens Help Customers 💡</h3>
    <p>Customers ko milta hai better value for money 💯</p>
    <p><strong>Customer benefits:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Affordable pricing</li>
      <li>Consistent taste every time</li>
      <li>Easy ordering via WhatsApp / apps</li>
      <li>Late-night availability 🌙</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>The Oven Vibe – Sundargarh's Cloud Kitchen 🍕🔥</h3>
    <p>
      The Oven Vibe is proud to be Sundargarh's trusted cloud kitchen—focused on fresh, affordable,
      and flavorful food.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Why People Love The Oven Vibe:</strong></p>
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0">
      <li>✔ Freshly prepared food</li>
      <li>✔ Budget-friendly menu</li>
      <li>✔ No compromise on quality</li>
      <li>✔ Perfect for students & families</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>Popular Menu Picks:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li>Paneer Makhni Royale Pizza</li>
      <li>Herb Paneer Delight Pizza</li>
      <li>Mushroom Supreme Pizza</li>
      <li>Vegie Onion Capsicum Pizza</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      <h3>Cloud Kitchen vs Traditional Restaurant ⚖️</h3>
      <p><strong>Traditional Restaurant:</strong> Higher prices, Dine-in costs, Slower service</p>
      <p><strong>Cloud Kitchen:</strong> Affordable food, Faster delivery, Better focus on taste</p>
      <p><strong>Clear winner? 😄 Cloud Kitchen!</strong></p>
    </div>

    <h3>Final Slice ☁️😋</h3>
    <p>
      Cloud kitchens sirf trend nahi hain—future hain 🍕 Aur Sundargarh jaise growing towns ke liye,
      yeh model perfect hai. Agar aap fresh, affordable aur fast food chahte ho—The Oven Vibe is the
      cloud kitchen you can trust 🔥
    </p>

    <a href={waLink} target="_blank" class="cta">
      👉 Order now on WhatsApp & experience the future of food with The Oven Vibe
    </a>
  </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
